# A closed loft held by a guide and square to a profile at once:
# loft_ring_guide.tlspr's ring through six circles round the z axis, the
# guide sketch's six cubics picked with the mouse from above and made
# the ring's guide by Features > Guide Loft by Selected Curves, then the
# ring's screen shown from the group list and its third profile's
# [change] given 1; the screen after it; the solid checked, a ring of
# one face.
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring_guide.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 386.6 250.0
down L 386.6 250.0
up L 386.6 250.0
move 300.0 200.0
down L 300.0 200.0
up L 300.0 200.0
move 213.4 250.0
down L 213.4 250.0
up L 213.4 250.0
move 213.4 350.0
down L 213.4 350.0
up L 213.4 350.0
move 300.0 400.0
down L 300.0 400.0
up L 300.0 400.0
move 386.6 350.0
down L 386.6 350.0
up L 386.6 350.0
menu Features|Guide Loft by Selected Curves
twmove 137 420
twdown L 137 420
twup L 137 420
